hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2922","Narrated to us Ali bin Khushram, who said: Ibn Uyaynah narrated to us, on the authority of Abd al-Karim, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Ibn Abi Layla, on the authority of Ali (RA), who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) commanded me to stand over his sacrificial camels (Budn)"","" and he commanded me not to give the slaughterer anything from them as payment.\"""""""
